    {
      "id": "ce874906-9be0-4114-ba1a-b87b7b92f0ba",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute a frase e associe a forma em espanhol ao sentido em português.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "93e54b27-aa79-4c50-b521-1398c00f21db",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Me despierto a las seis y cuarto.</strong></p><p>Em português: Eu acordo às seis e quinze.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/aef9966261594810a39eaf890950f300_b01-me-despierto.png?Expires=1794099503&Signature=19ICLJsFZTMySyCqbmVnQOeZaeuPlMxtXBtWZKkldhImAWGMU2jZB8W4lhqTJclBcHmAVeyTLoUMZu9CpHDQaHAmEUY7dNpK8M8SjkCDP2DogiFy4RwFvkXZ-YONIr5pKIJyhS4LgIwBul09jV8KmBaS4z~XTP~Dqg1R97k~5S-aYCL4YBgD9XIARqb-1D9YWLF0WskX1n7Wm0Dhy87wz-fAnkRwAZqLB-ZV4bwhLLLTwEGrG3tHujO1qayKn2KNSFCCWpdG1vJM4emZrI-yKfRxO3XplQVI9fePwsgMIWYVvfstRnDKslHFKQFOV7bxHkP~~zykij7tIx18HcLcPA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
