    {
      "id": "260776f8-e813-44a3-bd13-604995c64dd0",
      "title": "Leia a nota curta e repare em como o pronome muda o sentido da frase.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 3,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "fc8c92b2-62f2-46fe-a48a-89fe11e221c2",
          "textContent": "<p>Em <strong>me despierto</strong>, a ação volta para a própria pessoa.</p><p>O pronome <strong>me</strong> mostra que sou eu quem acorda.</p><p>No infinitivo, você vai encontrar a forma <strong>despertarse</strong>.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/630f11bf8a7b4e6282a5e9319e27c6f9_b01-me-despierto.mp3?Expires=1794099503&Signature=t2XN2YwsHSBW1-pAZsRQ0Nf6dIo2j4FNysvpvdd9A8xpOG4~4jtQzE5xaiyI972~Z8uIsVkJg~A004Nb7THLBhAwPNy6gH3H~vLlNhNfvvgf8WiozRkodv-SBa16IrOyNBoG2fIHW~v3JKIa7stCmJ8QTz-lOPEvW3~FhAUXxhGlOWAboPBc-WM5rlASE9ORJZ63niikLKNa1~N-EaPk5gVLNf7cKrmZvYQqeNswN-VpPm9EcrkJNba1nKizKOQucFR7P7knB-l2-iE8gf-JMyRbvJN-Y3nL6TCHOguZsuPwvVLWberzpkzWxjJG~fPo2ixq5zs6sf2iz3JAv87jtA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0ff27420-b2b4-4a62-98a3-75dbb26cc59c",
      "title": "Escute a nova frase e observe que agora a ação vai para outra pessoa.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "9098cd03-d504-4e94-971d-09d8270b7119",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Despierto a mi hermano a las siete.</strong></p><p>Em português: Eu acordo meu irmão às sete.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/5564a2bfc1464ad6b95a9c6837dc895c_b03-despierto-a-mi-hermano.mp3?Expires=1794099503&Signature=ECPyFpEpFVaKG1HC2R5UytYwa39sizK1PqCnP-NyhwFkni2Yme~Okl5Oj610fCntFLYaQOwABtBTuTZXVPQ0ShxYJ-N9z4Z40DYLffbQWj4uT2lGELpXNyGHz7IfA8SPeMpINM58s4XCla45oDZc-am3ls5J7q8kB0f7bYysIYpHG3iAhdRqoPsICX9TfGWhl~hNBnbGeaLUa7SWy5KTkY1yxx6fajNexBUA--6Gw00iE6e00s0gzBbqOsr791oieXZmjXB33d9ZEFkBKShsMOaZU9fv62PRps5VAIFZ-nAYxMnUjUXwiUVgGop-5FRlxoWYxBQOHYnQ3qDRVouqhw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5d1c73e7-f14e-48a3-abf5-4ad29a6e5640",
      "title": "Compare as duas frases e identifique o que muda no sentido.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "a69a2f6a-bfca-4b13-8210-2834adbe58a4",
          "textContent": "<p>Compare os dois usos.</p><ul><li><strong>Me despierto</strong>: eu acordo.</li><li><strong>Despierto a mi hermano</strong>: eu acordo outra pessoa.</li></ul><p>Com o pronome reflexivo, a frase fala da própria rotina. Sem ele, a ação passa para alguém.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "f23c402c-b8de-46a8-b7b4-1f801aae12e2",
      "title": "Escute a frase e note que o mesmo tipo de pronome aparece de novo.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 6,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "6dcb38f7-61ba-4721-bccf-e61a24894bba",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Me levanto enseguida.</strong></p><p>Em português: Eu me levanto logo em seguida.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/827f46bf60a348afa3631e94fec279fe_b05-me-levanto.mp3?Expires=1794099503&Signature=PNPRcC6CumXE88Gc8scIycZm3qlejTawThz-8KOJXQ81BkiTTCCUFLmtGW81jAThVSRag3WlFbxFlXof8RQVZTt5xsD-kiTkauUx7URi~5kNynZ7ZtNnYk9WPSun5Qaz7GXgKHNyepS0PLy0QJsIEZMPOq3hKq2Q5bo94Njrnc85RxOMvGCUXPMFLKaLIhFtZasqz9Y947k-KPo9yF4umeW-5WBNsM1i-L77XIrqqfq-uhOcZIhk~VQ5dgKyfeYuUhlRaTBU4LIkyrukKz-LEdMmec9XRy2w6H6PR9saj2Zloyuv8wwfjgrzgCZ6OYcvmaJnzSvJJ6jj0trPRlm59Q__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "a9b30b26-6995-43e9-8ea3-4ebf66446a89",
      "title": "Leia o quadro curto e compare como o mesmo verbo aparece com pessoas diferentes.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 7,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "a592436d-80be-47f4-933d-8de0dec8b08c",
          "textContent": "<p>Com <strong>levantarse</strong>, o pronome acompanha a pessoa.</p><ul><li><strong>me levanto</strong></li><li><strong>te levantas</strong></li><li><strong>se levanta</strong></li></ul><p>O verbo continua no presente, mas o pronome muda junto com quem faz a ação.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/827f46bf60a348afa3631e94fec279fe_b05-me-levanto.mp3?Expires=1794099503&Signature=PNPRcC6CumXE88Gc8scIycZm3qlejTawThz-8KOJXQ81BkiTTCCUFLmtGW81jAThVSRag3WlFbxFlXof8RQVZTt5xsD-kiTkauUx7URi~5kNynZ7ZtNnYk9WPSun5Qaz7GXgKHNyepS0PLy0QJsIEZMPOq3hKq2Q5bo94Njrnc85RxOMvGCUXPMFLKaLIhFtZasqz9Y947k-KPo9yF4umeW-5WBNsM1i-L77XIrqqfq-uhOcZIhk~VQ5dgKyfeYuUhlRaTBU4LIkyrukKz-LEdMmec9XRy2w6H6PR9saj2Zloyuv8wwfjgrzgCZ6OYcvmaJnzSvJJ6jj0trPRlm59Q__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ee6e7225-b77d-4777-963e-157809da3d46",
      "title": "Leia o fechamento e conecte cada frase a uma situação cotidiana.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 8,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "20dacbc3-5839-4a05-8ebf-3e0e55633cea",
          "textContent": "<p>Na vida real, esses verbos aparecem quando alguém conta a rotina da manhã em casa.</p><ul><li><strong>Me despierto a las seis y cuarto.</strong></li><li><strong>Me levanto enseguida.</strong></li><li><strong>Despierto a mi hermano a las siete.</strong></li></ul><p>O ponto central aqui é perceber quando a ação volta para a própria pessoa e quando vai para outra.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    }
  ],
